      "jcr:created": "Wed Apr 27 2022 18:28:58 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>“Over the years, our Operation Smile Ambassadors have invited speakers who have participated in medical mission trips, like colleagues, physicians and past patients, to educate us all on the importance of offering quality healthcare to communities all over the world,” says Catalina. “To see a child who is living a healthier life as a result of our donations reminds me of why I enjoy working in healthcare.”<br>\n</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Apr 27 2022 20:11:08 GMT+0000",
