      "jcr:created": "Wed Apr 27 2022 18:28:58 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">Driving inclusion in healthcare with Fundación Teletón</span></span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
